## Vendored battle-log fixtures

When this package vendors battle-log fixtures, they are copied from
[`@dierkens.dev/ptcgl-battle-log-parser`](https://github.com/cdierkens/ptcgl-battle-log-parser),
which is MIT and by the same author. They are vendored rather than imported
because the parser does not ship its fixtures in the published tarball
(`files: ["dist"]`). Player handles in them are the maintainers' own, redacted at
capture time by that package's fixture tool.

The vendored fixtures are the regression net for lowering. They are data about
the game, not code: no licence is asserted over the strings a battle log contains.

